    "rules": [
      "Inter for everything read, JetBrains Mono for everything labelled or quoted from a machine; no third face.",
      "Two weights: 400 and 600. Never mono in 600, never Inter in capitals.",
      "Inter is not tracked: its optical sizes space each size (the display cut is already tight); only labels open, by +2%. Word has only the text cut, so the templates tighten their titles (\u22122% at t3, \u22121% at t2).",
      "Italic only for titles of works and terms on first use; emphasis is 600.",
      "Figures in tables tabular (Inter's tnum); the name is always Inter 600, untracked."
    ]
